  "section": "Movie Facts # 7 of 10",
  "description": "In the scene on Hoth where Han Solo is about to go after Luke Skywalker, a dead tauntaun is seen on the floor being examined by 2-1B, the medical droid. On the wall is what appears to be some blood, presumably from the slaughtered animal. In the fourth draft of the script, one of the rebels says to his deck officer, \"...I can't imagine, sir. Their necks are broken.\" The wampas have already broken into Echo Base at this point and have obviously attacked some tauntauns. They break in once around the time of Han and Leia's argument in the hallway and again when C-3PO and R2-D2 are walking towards the hangar and commenting about the temperature in Leia's chamber."
